        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 0605J, Julienne Egg Knob with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClassically styled, the simplicity of the round rose combined with the elegant egg-shaped Julienne Knob will enhance the beauty of your home no matter if your home is styled contemporarily or traditionally. Available in oil rubbed bronze and satin nickel finishes. The Traditional Julienne Egg Knob is adjustable to fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. The backset is also adjustable for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches with a removable faceplate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis classic design knob is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\"><b>Weslock Traditionale Collection</b></a> which features solid brass construction backed by lifetime mechanical and finish warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Traditional Julienne Egg Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function meets ANSI A 156.2 Grade 2 cylindrical lock standards.</li>\r\n<li>Rose and knob material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latches include removable faceplates.</li>\r\n<li>5-pin lock cylinder for entry function.</li>\r\n<li>Removable door knob prevents scratching during installation.</li>\r\n<li>Panic-proof keyed entry and privacy functions - one turn of interior knob unlocks and opens door.</li>\r\n<li>Push-button locking rosette.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Julienne Egg Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Style: Egg</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Style: Round</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplate </li>\r\n<li>Fits doors prepared with 2-1/8\" cross hole and 1\" edge hole</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim. Does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock. Door knob operates latch from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking for privacy. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy lock; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (keyed lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. Locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and push button on interior rose. Turning inside knob will release lock and retract latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Julienne Egg Knob, Weslock 0605J",
                "description": "Weslock Traditional Julienne Egg Knob - Classically styled, the simplicity of the round rose combined with the elegant egg-shaped Julienne Knob will enhance the beauty of your home no matter if your home is styled contemporarily or traditionally. Available in  oil rubbed bronze and satin nickel finishes. The Traditional Julienne Egg Knob is adjustable to fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. The backset is also adjustable for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches with a removable faceplate.\r\n\r\n",
